# Nonlinear MRI production run behind Fig. 4 of COMPHY-D-26-00110.
#
# Tracked: the run definition, the job script, the stdout log and this README.
# Untracked but present in the directory (Dropbox-backed): rms.dat, cfl.dat,
# the NetCDF diagnostics output and the figures generated from it.  This
# follows tests/MHD_INCOMP(MRI)/.gitignore -- the output is reproducible from
# the input, and gallope.out.nc alone is larger than everything the repository
# tracks for this run.
